{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T22:44:38+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Dance of Fire and Ice", "steam_appid": 977950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [1977570, 1027880, 2016420], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dance of Fire and Ice</strong> (ADOFAI) is a simple one-button rhythm game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/81cc911206906fcb4b9593d730f6934e.poster.avif?t=1793318010\" width=464 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/81cc911206906fcb4b9593d730f6934e.webm?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/81cc911206906fcb4b9593d730f6934e.mp4?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press on every beat of the music to move in a line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/68bdf4e82676b753ea9e0f24ce77903a.poster.avif?t=1793318010\" width=456 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/68bdf4e82676b753ea9e0f24ce77903a.webm?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/68bdf4e82676b753ea9e0f24ce77903a.mp4?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pattern has its own rhythm to it. It can get difficult. This game is purely based on rhythm, so use your ears more than your sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/a41e9915a0c8585f7a8592e393a6a2b4.poster.avif?t=1793318010\" width=410 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/a41e9915a0c8585f7a8592e393a6a2b4.webm?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/a41e9915a0c8585f7a8592e393a6a2b4.mp4?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that it is quite strict and unforgiving. If you've played the Rhythm Heaven series - this is about as strict as that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/98bc50692f0adf72807084d524a1ac51.poster.avif?t=1793318010\" width=500 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/98bc50692f0adf72807084d524a1ac51.webm?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/98bc50692f0adf72807084d524a1ac51.mp4?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the cosmos:</strong> Soar through each genre of music in a variety of colorful fantasy landscapes.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Predict every moment:</strong> With a track that shows you every rhythm ahead of time, you’ll learn to sight-read levels as they come. No tricks, and nothing is reaction-based.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play new levels for free: </strong>Tackle new songs and new rhythms as we expand the game with free level patches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop Support:</strong> Create, share, and play countless user-made custom levels through our Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calibrate your experience:</strong> Manually adjust your calibration on-the-fly, or use our auto-calibration method. The game is precisely timed, and you won’t experience any slow desync over time like you might with other music-based twitch games. (We’re musicians and off-sync games hurt us.)</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dance of Fire and Ice</strong> (ADOFAI) is a simple one-button rhythm game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/81cc911206906fcb4b9593d730f6934e.poster.avif?t=1793318010\" width=464 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/81cc911206906fcb4b9593d730f6934e.webm?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/81cc911206906fcb4b9593d730f6934e.mp4?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press on every beat of the music to move in a line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/68bdf4e82676b753ea9e0f24ce77903a.poster.avif?t=1793318010\" width=456 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/68bdf4e82676b753ea9e0f24ce77903a.webm?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/68bdf4e82676b753ea9e0f24ce77903a.mp4?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pattern has its own rhythm to it. It can get difficult. This game is purely based on rhythm, so use your ears more than your sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/a41e9915a0c8585f7a8592e393a6a2b4.poster.avif?t=1793318010\" width=410 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/a41e9915a0c8585f7a8592e393a6a2b4.webm?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/a41e9915a0c8585f7a8592e393a6a2b4.mp4?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that it is quite strict and unforgiving. If you've played the Rhythm Heaven series - this is about as strict as that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/98bc50692f0adf72807084d524a1ac51.poster.avif?t=1793318010\" width=500 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/98bc50692f0adf72807084d524a1ac51.webm?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/extras/98bc50692f0adf72807084d524a1ac51.mp4?t=1793318010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the cosmos:</strong> Soar through each genre of music in a variety of colorful fantasy landscapes.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Predict every moment:</strong> With a track that shows you every rhythm ahead of time, you’ll learn to sight-read levels as they come. No tricks, and nothing is reaction-based.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play new levels for free: </strong>Tackle new songs and new rhythms as we expand the game with free level patches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop Support:</strong> Create, share, and play countless user-made custom levels through our Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calibrate your experience:</strong> Manually adjust your calibration on-the-fly, or use our auto-calibration method. The game is precisely timed, and you won’t experience any slow desync over time like you might with other music-based twitch games. (We’re musicians and off-sync games hurt us.)</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A Dance of Fire and Ice (ADOFAI) is a strict rhythm game. Keep your focus as you guide two orbiting planets along a winding path without breaking their perfect equilibrium.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Romanian, Russian, Vietnamese, Czech, French, German", "reviews": "“This game is fantastic ... ingenious level designs ... visualizes rhythms in a way no rhythm game has done before.”<br>9/10 – Etienne<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/header.jpg?t=1793318010", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793318010", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793318010", "website": "https://7thbe.at", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memor